        "flex_gap": {
          "unit": "px",
          "size": 20
        }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "bc0003d",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Jesus Christ is the Son of God and is equal with the Father. Jesus lived a sinless life on earth and offered Himself as the perfect sacrifice, dying on the cross for all humanity. He rose from the dead after three days, demonstrating His power over sin and death. He ascended to heavenly glory and will return to earth as King of kings and Lord of lords.</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_body"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc0003f",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scripture references",
            "header_size": "h3",
            "__globals__": {
              "title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_refs"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc00040",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Matthew 1:22-23; Isaiah 9:6; John 1:1-5, 14:10-30; Hebrews 4:14,15; 1 Corinthians 15:3-4; Romans 1:3-4; Acts 1:9-11; 1 Timothy 6:14; Titus 2:13</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_zh"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "text-editor"
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "bc00046",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "full",
        "flex_direction": "column",
        "flex_gap": {
          "unit": "px",
          "size": 20
        }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "bc00042",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>The Holy Spirit is equal with the Father and the Son. He is present in the world to help people know Christ, and He lives in every Christian from the moment of salvation. He gives believers power for daily living, understanding of spiritual truth and guidance for the way ahead. He gives spiritual gifts to every believer. As Christians, we seek daily to live under the Holy Spirit’s direction.</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_body"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc00044",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scripture references",
            "header_size": "h3",
            "__globals__": {
              "title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_refs"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc00045",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>2 Corinthians 3:17; John 16:7-13, 14:16-17; Acts 1:8; 1 Corinthians 2:12; 3:16 Ephesians 1:13,5:18; Galatians 5:25</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_zh"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
