        "flex_gap": {
          "unit": "px",
          "size": 20
        }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "bc0004c",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Human beings were created in God’s spiritual image, reflecting His character. Humanity is the pinnacle of God’s creation. Although every person has the potential for good, our sinful attitudes separate us from God and bring many problems into our lives.</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_body"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc0004e",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scripture references",
            "header_size": "h3",
            "__globals__": {
              "title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_refs"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc0004f",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Genesis 1:27; Psalms 8:3-6; Isaiah 53:6a; Romans 3:23; Isaiah 59:1-2</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_zh"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "text-editor"
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "bc00055",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "full",
        "flex_direction": "column",
        "flex_gap": {
          "unit": "px",
          "size": 20
        }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "bc00051",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Salvation is God’s free gift, which we must receive. We can never atone for our sins through good works or self-improvement. Only through Jesus Christ and God’s forgiveness can we be delivered from the penalty of sin. We are saved when we turn in faith to Jesus from a self-centred life lived in our own strength. Eternal life begins when we receive the life of Jesus Christ by faith.</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_body"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc00053",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scripture references",
            "header_size": "h3",
            "__globals__": {
              "title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_refs"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc00054",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Romans 6:23,5:1; Ephesians 2:8-9; John 14:6;1:12; Titus 3:5; Galatians 3:26</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_zh"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "text-editor"
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "bc0005a",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "full",
        "flex_direction": "column",
        "flex_gap": {
          "unit": "px",
          "size": 20
        }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "bc00056",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Because God gives us eternal life through Jesus Christ, true believers have eternal assurance of salvation. Salvation comes through God’s power and grace, not through a Christian’s own efforts. His preserving power and grace give us this lasting assurance. Believers also have a responsibility to continue trusting God and living in His care.</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_body"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc00058",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scripture references",
            "header_size": "h3",
            "__globals__": {
              "title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_refs"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc00059",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>John 10:29; 2 Timothy 1:12; Hebrews 7:25, 10:10,14; 1 Peter 1:3-5; Hebrews 6:4-8; Hebrews 10:26-27; John 15:6</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_zh"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
