    {
      "id": "bc0005f",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "full",
        "flex_direction": "column",
        "flex_gap": {
          "unit": "px",
          "size": 20
        }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "bc0005b",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>People were created to exist forever. We will either be eternally separated from God because of sin, or live eternally with Him through forgiveness and salvation. Eternal separation from God is hell; eternal life is being with God forever.</p>",
            "__globals__": {
              "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text",
              "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=interior_body"
            }
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
